{"Header.scss uses mixins but does not show an explicit import of foundation/mixins within itself, causing potential compile failures if compiled in isolation": 0.023081747815012932, "Many components still use floats (topic.scss, header.scss pre-migration sections, admin coalitions) creating inconsistent layout behavior across pages until floats are removed everywhere": 0.03466160222887993, "CHANGELOG.md is missing or not updated with release notes for foundation/mixins.scss changes or new flexbox mixins": 0.006036205217242241, "Header title changed from float left to @include flexbox() and @include align-items(center), potentially altering flow and alignment if parent is not a flex container": 0.17901334166526794, "New flexbox mixins (flexbox(), inline-flex(), align-items(), order()) introduced in foundation/mixins.scss could cause build failures or inconsistent styling if not consistently applied": 0.04862212762236595, "Foundation mixins are imported before foundation variables in common.scss, inconsistent with other files like foundation/base.scss that import variables first": 0.003317560302093625, ".small-action class now becomes a flex container which could alter spacing and alignment with downstream children that rely on previous float/inline-block behavior": 0.33658653497695923, "Small-action area gains flexbox usage creating dependency on flex container context; if internal structure relies on floats, layout could regress": 0.1631195843219757, "Extra-info-wrapper gains @include order(2) and line-height: 1.5 which may affect alignment with badges and topic title": 0.047476477921009064, "Extra-info-wrapper uses @include order(2) which relies on flex container ancestor; if parent is not flex container, order has no effect": 0.18252234160900116, "Badge bullet styling replaces direct display: inline-flex and align-items with mixins, introducing dependency on new mixins and potentially altering layout for inline badge elements": 0.13055013120174408, "PR description is insufficient, missing detailed description of changes, migration steps, testing plan, and follow-up work": 0.004352282732725143, "No Sass-specific tests found in the repo to test mixin behavior": 0.00895740557461977}